1
00:00:10,552 --> 00:00:14,889
EPISODE 2

2
00:00:14,973 --> 00:00:17,684
{\an8}Foolish Brother. Ever the imbecile.

3
00:00:18,435 --> 00:00:22,814
{\an8}The day has come when you
might actually prove of some use.

4
00:00:22,897 --> 00:00:24,107
{\an8}Listen here, asshole--

5
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:27,610
{\an8}What the hell
are you three planning to do?

6
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:28,695
{\an8}Planning?

7
00:00:28,778 --> 00:00:32,240
{\an8}Feels more like it's already on.

8
00:00:33,616 --> 00:00:36,244
Tell me this isn't real!

9
00:00:39,038 --> 00:00:41,541
A coronation for the new king?

10
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:44,002
Wow! This suspense is killing me!

11
00:00:44,085 --> 00:00:47,088
I hear we're gettin' our asses blasted
so we come together as one.

12
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:50,216
Like, all the gods from Heaven
are legit assembling!

13
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,676
So cool!

14
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:55,513
O mighty gods of all the realms above!

15
00:00:55,597 --> 00:01:00,268
I thank you for gathering here,
all for me.

16
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:03,062
-Booyah!
-You da God!

17
00:01:03,146 --> 00:01:06,399
I, Ramie, your new King,
hereby declare the following.

18
00:01:06,483 --> 00:01:09,611
To preserve the fractured
order of this fallen Heaven,

19
00:01:09,694 --> 00:01:12,447
I shall unite the gods as one.

20
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:17,577
Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!
Praise be!

21
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:21,289
And now, without further ado,

22
00:01:22,415 --> 00:01:25,251
consider these your final moments.

23
00:01:26,628 --> 00:01:27,712
Huh?

24
00:01:30,507 --> 00:01:32,675
-He's sealing them in something.
-What's that smoke?

25
00:01:33,551 --> 00:01:35,970
They're stoned! And not in the good way!

26
00:01:36,513 --> 00:01:39,140
What's the deal
with turning gods into fucking rocks?

27
00:01:39,224 --> 00:01:40,892
Just watch and learn.

28
00:01:40,975 --> 00:01:44,979
<i>O leaderless flock,</i>
<i>with no shepherd to follow.</i>

29
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:47,649
<i>O fallen gods, drunk on liberty.</i>

30
00:01:47,732 --> 00:01:51,402
<i>You who have reduced Heaven</i>
<i>to a decaying pit of sloth and chaos.</i>

31
00:01:51,486 --> 00:01:53,613
<i>Judgment Day is upon ye!</i>

32
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:00,495
<i>All liberties are hereby rescinded</i>

33
00:02:01,204 --> 00:02:03,373
<i>to make way for a new purpose.</i>

34
00:02:03,456 --> 00:02:06,167
<i>Let thy flesh be sealed in stone</i>

35
00:02:06,251 --> 00:02:09,462
<i>then ground to ashes and refined</i>

36
00:02:09,546 --> 00:02:14,425
<i>to be cast anew as the greatest</i>
<i>explosive power known to godkind!</i>

37
00:02:14,509 --> 00:02:15,760
<i>Be delivered!</i>

38
00:02:16,302 --> 00:02:17,303
By God…

39
00:02:17,387 --> 00:02:22,642
The Forbidden Ancient Heavenly Weapon,
forged from the life force of the gods.

40
00:02:22,725 --> 00:02:25,144
It's God Bless You!

41
00:02:25,228 --> 00:02:28,106
-God…
-Bless You?

42
00:02:28,189 --> 00:02:32,402
Indeed. As your new King,
I have unified the gods.

43
00:02:32,485 --> 00:02:36,823
Now, to rejoice in the Heavenly Weapon,
born from the essence of the gods.

44
00:02:36,906 --> 00:02:39,117
A grand celebration, conceived by me,
blessed by me, for me alone.

45
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,702
And it shall be called…

46
00:02:42,203 --> 00:02:44,080
God Festival!

47
00:02:44,873 --> 00:02:47,125
A.K.A… God Fes!

48
00:02:49,377 --> 00:02:53,673
But alas,
God Fes must come to an abrupt end.

49
00:02:53,756 --> 00:02:58,136
To the daughters of Linière, my brother,
the one who drowned Heaven in debauchery,

50
00:02:58,219 --> 00:03:01,097
trust that your moment
of reckoning is nigh.

51
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:03,975
For you are about to bear witness…

52
00:03:06,686 --> 00:03:08,730
Behold! Your worst nightmares!

53
00:03:09,814 --> 00:03:13,359
My Heavenly Weapon of the gods!

54
00:03:13,443 --> 00:03:16,863
So freaking lit! Whoo!

55
00:03:16,946 --> 00:03:20,575
Flex it!
The Heavenly Weapon is totally bussin'!

56
00:03:21,242 --> 00:03:23,077
Lame as hell! The hell is this crap?

57
00:03:23,161 --> 00:03:26,873
That shit is nasty. And this is supposed
to be your Heavenly Weapon?

58
00:03:26,956 --> 00:03:29,250
Hey, Ramie. He's got the same mug as you.

59
00:03:30,043 --> 00:03:33,880
It seems the denizens of Heaven
all share the most vulgar of tastes.

60
00:03:33,963 --> 00:03:36,049
My eyes are begging me for mercy.

61
00:03:36,132 --> 00:03:37,800
This is crazy, like actually crazy!

62
00:03:37,884 --> 00:03:40,637
God's on another level!
Woo! Woo!

63
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:43,723
What a buzzkill!
Old dude acting hype? Can't!

64
00:03:44,349 --> 00:03:47,810
Not gonna lie, that's mad annoying.
Please stop.

65
00:03:47,894 --> 00:03:48,895
Woo…

66
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:52,774
And these demons are ruining the vibes
and sending God Fes into its flop era.

67
00:03:52,857 --> 00:03:56,694
King Ramie, heavenly unlawful entry
is, like, totally a crime.

68
00:03:56,778 --> 00:03:59,697
That means we gotta kill 'em, right?

69
00:03:59,781 --> 00:04:01,366
-Scanty!
-Kneesocks!

70
00:04:01,449 --> 00:04:02,450
Hold on a moment!

71
00:04:02,533 --> 00:04:06,537
As a dedicated servant of God,
I came prepared for this very occasion.

72
00:04:06,621 --> 00:04:08,498
My Lord! I have gifts for you.

73
00:04:09,624 --> 00:04:12,710
These babies are guaranteed to get any
god or angel packing to the great beyond!

74
00:04:12,794 --> 00:04:15,004
You'll see every one of these is divine.
Please, accept--

75
00:04:15,088 --> 00:04:17,090
How dare you bring such filth into Heaven!

76
00:04:17,173 --> 00:04:18,591
Oh, my God!

77
00:04:18,675 --> 00:04:20,093
Enough.

78
00:04:21,928 --> 00:04:23,763
You want us? Here we fucking are.

79
00:04:23,846 --> 00:04:26,349
This shit's going down on our turf,
so leave them out of it.

80
00:04:26,432 --> 00:04:29,727
If y'all motherfuckers want blood,
come and take it from us.

81
00:04:30,561 --> 00:04:32,855
-Panty…
-Stocking…

82
00:04:33,773 --> 00:04:34,774
You two…

83
00:04:39,696 --> 00:04:42,365
What is this? Our brainless little
angels trying to strike a pose?

84
00:04:42,448 --> 00:04:43,449
Huh?

85
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:45,326
"Leave them out of it."

86
00:04:45,410 --> 00:04:47,453
"If you want blood, come
and take it from us."

87
00:04:47,537 --> 00:04:51,040
Such a pitiful display of
secondhand embarrassment.

88
00:04:51,124 --> 00:04:54,043
Zip it, you fuckin' demon!
I ain't trying to impress anyone!

89
00:04:54,127 --> 00:04:58,631
You're in no position to be acting tough.
We're actually trying to save your asses!

90
00:04:58,715 --> 00:05:01,759
Under what misguided notion makes you
think we require saving at your hands?

91
00:05:01,843 --> 00:05:04,721
-Shut up, you cretinous hag!
-Quiet, you plain Jane.

92
00:05:04,804 --> 00:05:05,972
You want some? Huh?

93
00:05:06,055 --> 00:05:08,725
-Bring it, bitch!
-Go to hell, bitch!

94
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:10,351
Girls! Stop fighting!

95
00:05:10,435 --> 00:05:12,979
These guys really slept on the assignment.

96
00:05:13,062 --> 00:05:15,565
Fucking basic bitches!

97
00:05:16,983 --> 00:05:17,984
Damn skanks!

98
00:05:23,865 --> 00:05:26,617
Oh, no!

99
00:05:29,412 --> 00:05:31,831
-Oops.
-Now we've done it.

100
00:05:31,914 --> 00:05:34,834
Bruh! The demons and the human
literally just ghosted us for real!

101
00:05:34,917 --> 00:05:37,128
King Ramie! Permission to chase?

102
00:05:37,211 --> 00:05:39,047
There will be no need.

103
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:40,131
-But my Lord!
-But my Lord!

104
00:05:40,214 --> 00:05:43,718
The living mortal will go back to Earth,

105
00:05:43,801 --> 00:05:45,928
and the demons will return to Hell.

106
00:05:46,012 --> 00:05:47,305
Isn't that right?

107
00:05:48,181 --> 00:05:51,601
Now that I have the Heavenly Weapon,

108
00:05:51,684 --> 00:05:53,811
the power to destroy Earth and Hell
is within my grasp.

109
00:05:53,895 --> 00:05:56,355
Both mortals and demons alike
are doomed to meet their end.

110
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,732
You're so smart, your Highness!

111
00:05:58,357 --> 00:06:00,651
The fuck you up to this time?

112
00:06:02,653 --> 00:06:04,947
Like father, like daughter.

113
00:06:05,031 --> 00:06:07,116
Quite the slippery fingers you have.

114
00:06:12,163 --> 00:06:13,206
-The hell?
-The hell?

115
00:06:13,289 --> 00:06:16,250
I've received reports from my sons.

116
00:06:16,334 --> 00:06:20,963
You were living under the same roof
as those wretches, weren't you?

117
00:06:21,047 --> 00:06:24,175
Cohabiting with filthy demons.

118
00:06:24,258 --> 00:06:30,056
Such character falls short of the dignity
required to be first and second in line.

119
00:06:30,139 --> 00:06:35,686
You have no idea how many nights
I've wept over the future of the heavens.

120
00:06:35,770 --> 00:06:39,357
While foolish gods like my brother

121
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:41,943
are praised and exalted for doing nothing!

122
00:06:42,026 --> 00:06:45,988
But now, with the gods unified as one,
it is time to reset this wretched plain.

123
00:06:46,072 --> 00:06:47,365
-Heaven will now be…
-Your Highness?

124
00:06:47,448 --> 00:06:50,868
Newly opened!

125
00:06:53,913 --> 00:06:56,958
I can't stand any more
of this father-son shit show.

126
00:06:57,041 --> 00:06:59,669
I couldn't care less about
your pathetic ambitions.

127
00:06:59,752 --> 00:07:03,089
But we're angels, not gods,
so why turn us into stones?

128
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:06,050
Sounds like someone's
raggin' on his Highness.

129
00:07:06,134 --> 00:07:08,803
Hell nah. We ain't taking that shit
without some serious clap back!

130
00:07:08,886 --> 00:07:10,763
Stand down, my sons.

131
00:07:10,847 --> 00:07:15,601
My doltish nieces
still have their part to play in all this.

132
00:07:16,269 --> 00:07:20,231
I must have them witness everything
from the best seats in the house.

133
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:26,821
That's right! Front-row warhead seats
to witness the world's downfall.

134
00:07:26,904 --> 00:07:32,034
Your Highness. I think the Heavenly Weapon
is locked and loaded and ready to fire.

135
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:34,495
Excellent. In that case,

136
00:07:35,121 --> 00:07:39,292
consider this a little preview
before the main event.

137
00:07:40,001 --> 00:07:42,587
Prepare the Heavenly Catapult.

138
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:44,881
-What is that?
-A big slide?

139
00:07:45,715 --> 00:07:47,383
Oh, my God!

140
00:07:47,466 --> 00:07:49,468
UFO is coming!

141
00:07:51,637 --> 00:07:55,266
This is but a mere drop
of the sheer power that is the gods.

142
00:07:55,349 --> 00:07:57,476
With this, I do declare…

143
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,896
We are now at war with Hell.

144
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:15,161
I know this place!
This is the Dark Arms Dealer, Gunsmith--

145
00:08:15,244 --> 00:08:20,917
Got it. Down the hatch, vitals stop,
and 24 hours to get in and out of Heaven.

146
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,293
Bottoms up!

147
00:08:23,085 --> 00:08:26,464
Y'know, it's not like just anyone
can waltz right into Heaven.

148
00:08:31,719 --> 00:08:32,803
Panty! Stocking!

149
00:08:33,888 --> 00:08:35,806
-Where am I?
-Whatever do you mean?

150
00:08:35,890 --> 00:08:38,768
You two have been slacking
on gathering those Hell Coins.

151
00:08:38,851 --> 00:08:41,229
As such, your entry ban has been extended.

152
00:08:41,312 --> 00:08:43,314
Hell Coins? That's right, we were
supposed to gather those.

153
00:08:43,397 --> 00:08:45,399
Surely 60% should be sufficient?

154
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:46,776
Scanty, Kneesocks…

155
00:08:46,859 --> 00:08:48,986
-Oh, hello, Garter.
-Where are we?

156
00:08:49,070 --> 00:08:51,030
We're at Hell's Border.

157
00:08:51,113 --> 00:08:52,949
Holy Hell! I'm in Hell?

158
00:08:53,032 --> 00:08:56,035
That goddamn harlot of a gunsmith.
She did me dirty!

159
00:08:56,118 --> 00:09:01,040
-You'll not get away with turning us away!
-Change of plans. Back to Earth for me.

160
00:09:01,832 --> 00:09:06,045
Oh, hell naw! I forgot to ask
how I even make my way back to Earth!

161
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:09,507
How am I gonna get back to Earth,
let alone back into Heaven?

162
00:09:09,590 --> 00:09:11,759
Why on earth would you
want to go back there?

163
00:09:11,842 --> 00:09:13,261
After the way they treated you?

164
00:09:13,344 --> 00:09:16,639
<i>Ramie's used the gods</i>
<i>to create his Heavenly Weapon.</i>

165
00:09:16,722 --> 00:09:20,268
<i>If memory serves right,</i>
<i>that thing holds unimaginable power.</i>

166
00:09:20,351 --> 00:09:23,938
<i>It's got the power to destroy</i>
<i>not just Earth, but Hell as well.</i>

167
00:09:24,021 --> 00:09:26,399
<i>A goddamn weapon that should</i>
<i>never see the light of day!</i>

168
00:09:26,482 --> 00:09:28,067
Scanty, Kneesocks.

169
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:31,570
You must come with me to Heaven
and help me save Panty and Stocking.

170
00:09:31,654 --> 00:09:33,990
-Excuse me?
-And why exactly should we be bothered?

171
00:09:34,073 --> 00:09:37,743
This mere mortal here?
I'm hopeless on my own!

172
00:09:37,827 --> 00:09:39,912
We're gonna need your
demon power on the squad too.

173
00:09:39,996 --> 00:09:43,916
You think we give two hoots about
what happens to those asinine twerps?

174
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,543
Dear Sister is right--

175
00:09:45,626 --> 00:09:49,046
We lived together.
We broke bread with you.

176
00:09:49,130 --> 00:09:50,423
Does that count for nothing?

177
00:09:51,173 --> 00:09:53,384
Remember all the times you spent together.

178
00:09:53,467 --> 00:09:56,554
-<i>So basically, you're freeloaders.</i>
-<i>Freeloaders? Lame.</i>

179
00:09:56,637 --> 00:09:59,473
-<i>Get your shit together, housemaid.</i>
-<i>You, fucking demon four eyes.</i>

180
00:10:00,558 --> 00:10:03,561
Those fucking bitches!

181
00:10:04,186 --> 00:10:05,396
Dear Sister!

182
00:10:05,479 --> 00:10:07,648
Let's go, Kneesocks.

183
00:10:07,732 --> 00:10:10,109
So we're all going to Heaven?

184
00:10:10,192 --> 00:10:14,947
We are. Gotta knock some sense into those
shrews before we kill them ourselves.

185
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:17,366
Couldn't have said it
better myself, Dear Sister.

186
00:10:18,284 --> 00:10:19,994
What in hell is this?

187
00:10:20,077 --> 00:10:23,080
This can only be the work of the gods!

188
00:10:23,164 --> 00:10:25,958
We gotta head toward the light.
That's where Heaven is!

189
00:10:27,668 --> 00:10:31,630
Look, Chuck. That horrible border
looks so small from here.

190
00:10:31,714 --> 00:10:35,259
Who knew getting into Heaven
was as easy as just keeling over?

191
00:10:35,343 --> 00:10:36,344
Chuck, chuck.

192
00:10:36,427 --> 00:10:39,138
You're right. We can't relax just yet.

193
00:10:39,221 --> 00:10:42,683
We gotta find Panty and tell her
what that nasty Ramie's got in store.

194
00:10:42,767 --> 00:10:43,851
Chuck!

195
00:10:43,934 --> 00:10:45,311
<i>No gods! No gods!</i>

196
00:10:45,394 --> 00:10:47,813
No gods? What are you talking about?

197
00:10:47,897 --> 00:10:50,232
Whoa! Someone's coming!
What do we do? Hide!

198
00:10:50,316 --> 00:10:53,944
Sheesh! I am so amped with all this hype.

199
00:10:55,237 --> 00:10:56,906
What is that? Some stray cat?

200
00:10:56,989 --> 00:10:59,075
Bruh, come on. That's totally a dog.

201
00:10:59,617 --> 00:11:01,160
-Cutie!
-What a good boy!

202
00:11:01,243 --> 00:11:02,912
<i>No gods! No gods!</i>

203
00:11:02,995 --> 00:11:04,205
You good?

204
00:11:04,288 --> 00:11:07,875
-I always wanted a dog of my own.
-Bruh, me too!

205
00:11:07,958 --> 00:11:11,379
It is God Fes, after all.
Maybe his Highness will let us keep him?

206
00:11:11,462 --> 00:11:12,588
Bleurgh…

207
00:11:12,671 --> 00:11:14,590
Yep. You look like an Eros.

208
00:11:15,383 --> 00:11:16,801
Come on, Eros!

209
00:11:16,884 --> 00:11:19,512
Well, they haven't found me yet.

210
00:11:21,138 --> 00:11:23,140
Panty! Stocking!

211
00:11:23,224 --> 00:11:25,142
Whoa! They're pissed as hell
being turned into stone!

212
00:11:25,226 --> 00:11:26,769
And is that Ramie?

213
00:11:26,852 --> 00:11:30,147
I am in way over my head here!

214
00:11:30,231 --> 00:11:33,150
I'll remember this…

215
00:11:33,234 --> 00:11:36,529
Fucking old dudes and their God complexes…

216
00:11:36,612 --> 00:11:37,905
Don't forget,

217
00:11:38,823 --> 00:11:41,951
today is a day for celebration.

218
00:11:44,954 --> 00:11:49,917
EPISODE 3

219
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,045
{\an8}How much higher is it to Heaven?

220
00:11:53,129 --> 00:11:55,172
{\an8}What Dear Sister said.

221
00:11:55,256 --> 00:11:56,841
{\an8}Shut the hell up and climb, damn it!

222
00:11:59,218 --> 00:12:00,344
{\an8}What is that?

223
00:12:02,304 --> 00:12:03,305
Is that…

224
00:12:04,181 --> 00:12:05,599
gunpowder?

225
00:12:05,683 --> 00:12:07,017
I know what that means.

226
00:12:07,101 --> 00:12:13,315
This is the legendary Heavenly Catapult,
the Heavenly Weapon's shooting mechanism!

227
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:15,901
Lucifer's left nipple!
Holy Mother of Hell!

228
00:12:15,985 --> 00:12:17,903
Exquisite!

229
00:12:17,987 --> 00:12:21,157
What sheer power within a single grain
of fine powder of the gods!

230
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:26,662
The Heavenly Weapon must be a billion…
No, ten billion times stronger!

231
00:12:26,745 --> 00:12:30,499
Your Highness. The Heavenly Weapon
is locked and loaded.

232
00:12:31,250 --> 00:12:34,587
Jesus Christ, is he tryna start a war?

233
00:12:34,670 --> 00:12:38,591
That shouldn't be enough
to awaken Father…

234
00:12:38,674 --> 00:12:40,843
We cannot let that titanic statue fall.

235
00:12:40,926 --> 00:12:42,178
We must hurry.

236
00:12:42,803 --> 00:12:44,054
Fas!

237
00:12:44,138 --> 00:12:46,265
-Fastener.
-Unleash everything you've got.

238
00:12:46,348 --> 00:12:47,349
